#: ../../chapter02.rst:3
msgid "2 Installation"
msgstr "2 Installation"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:6
msgid ""
"You can download and install the File Server Agent software directly from"
" the Web Portal. Complete the following steps to install the |prodname| "
"File Server Agent software on your file server."
msgstr "Du kan downloade og installere File Server Agent-softwaren direkte fra webportalen. Følg nedenstående trin for at installere |prodname| File Server Agent-softwaren på din filserver."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:11
msgid "2.1 System Requirement"
msgstr "2.1 Systemkrav"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:13
msgid "File Server Agent can be installed on the following OS"
msgstr "File Server Agent kan installeres på følgende OS"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:15
msgid "Server OS"
msgstr "Server OS"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:17
msgid "Windows 2022"
msgstr "Windows 2022"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:18
msgid "Windows 2019"
msgstr "Windows 2019"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:19
msgid "Windows 2016"
msgstr "Windows 2016"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:21
msgid "Client OS"
msgstr "Klient OS"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:23
msgid "Windows 10"
msgstr "Windows 10"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:24
msgid "Windows 8.1"
msgstr "Windows 8.1"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:25
msgid "Windows 8.0"
msgstr "Windows 8.0"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:26
msgid "Windows 7"
msgstr "Windows 7"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:27
msgid "Windows Vista"
msgstr "Windows Vista"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:28
msgid "Windows XP"
msgstr "Windows XP"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:33
msgid "2.2 Preparation"
msgstr "2.2 Forberedelse"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:35
msgid ""
"File Server Agent depends on .NET framework 2.0 or later. If you are "
"installing the file Server Agent on Windows Server 2022/2019/2016, you "
"need to prepare the .NET environment. This usually can be done from the "
"Windows Server Manager > Manage Roles and Features and then in the "
"features section, select .NET Framework 3.5"
msgstr "File Server Agent afhænger af .NET framework 2.0 eller nyere. Hvis du installerer File Server Agent på Windows Server 2022/2019/2016, skal du forberede .NET-miljøet. Dette kan som regel gøres fra Windows Server Manager > Administrer Roller og Funktioner og derefter i funktioner-sektionen, vælg .NET Framework 3.5"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:40
msgid "WINDOWS SERVER 2016 .NET FRAMEWORK FEATURE"
msgstr "WINDOWS SERVER 2016 .NET FRAMEWORK FEATURE"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:43
msgid ""
"If you are installing File Server Agent on Windows 8/Windows 10, you can "
"get .NET framework 2.0 (3.5) installed from \"Program Files\" -> Windows "
"Components."
msgstr "Hvis du installerer File Server Agent på Windows 8/Windows 10, kan du få .NET framework 2.0 (3.5) installeret fra \"Programfiler\" -> Windows-komponenter."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:48
msgid "WINDOWS 10 .NET FRAMEWORK 3.5 FEATURE"
msgstr "WINDOWS 10 .NET FRAMEWORK 3.5 FUNKTION"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:53
msgid "2.3 Install"
msgstr "2.3 Installér"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:57
msgid ""
"Always install |prodname| File Server Agent as a Tenant Administrator "
"when you are at the login dialog."
msgstr "Installer altid |prodname| File Server Agent som en Tenant Administrator, når du er ved login-dialogen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:59
msgid ""
"File Server Agent belongs to a specific Tenant instead of belonging to a "
"specific user. So it is best to download the File Server Agent as the "
"Tenant Administrator and set it up to connect to the same Tenant "
"Administrator's account."
msgstr "File Server Agent hører til en specifik lejer i stedet for at tilhøre en specifik bruger. Derfor er det bedst at downloade File Server Agent som lejeradministratoren og opsætte den til at forbinde til den samme lejeradministrators konto."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:62
msgid "Step 1 - Download the Installer Package"
msgstr "Trin 1 - Download installationspakken"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:64
msgid ""
"From the File Server you wish to install the File Server Agent; open a "
"browser and log in to the Web Portal as the Tenant Administrator. From "
"the Management Console, click the **(+)** in the \"Remote Active "
"Directory\" section on the right-hand side."
msgstr "Fra filserveren, hvor du ønsker at installere File Server Agent; åbn en browser og log ind på Webportalen som Tenant Administrator. Fra Management Console skal du klikke på **(+)** i sektionen \"Fjern Active Directory\" i højre side."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:69
msgid "SERVER AGENT DOWNLOADS ACCESS"
msgstr "SERVERAGENT DOWNLOADS ADGANG"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:71
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, choose your Download Package from the pull-down "
"menu and click **Go** to begin the installation."
msgstr "I pop op-vinduet skal du vælge din Downloadpakke fra rullemenuen og klikke på **Go** for at starte installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:73
msgid ""
"A window will open. Click the MSI file at the bottom of the browser to "
"open the installer."
msgstr "Et vindue vil åbne. Klik på MSI-filen i bunden af browseren for at åbne installationsprogrammet."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:78
msgid "OPEN THE INSTALLER"
msgstr "ÅBN INSTALLATIONSPROGRAMMET"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:82
msgid ""
"File Server agent software is capable of synchronizing three things "
"between the local file server and remote cloud storage account."
msgstr "Filserveragentsoftwaren er i stand til at synkronisere tre ting mellem den lokale filserver og den fjernbetjente cloudlagringskonto."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:84
msgid "synchronize selected files and folders."
msgstr "synkroniser valgte filer og mapper."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:85
msgid "synchronize selected Active Directory users from local to cloud."
msgstr "synkroniser valgte Active Directory-brugere fra lokal til sky."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:86
msgid "synchronize NTFS permissions on the local file server to cloud."
msgstr "synkroniser NTFS-tilladelserne på den lokale filserver til skyen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:88
msgid ""
"You can start installing file server agent from \"Adding Remote Active "
"Directory\" or from \"Adding Team Folder via Remote Server Agent\"."
msgstr "Du kan begynde at installere filserveragenten fra \"Tilføjelse af fjern Active Directory\" eller fra \"Tilføjelse af Team Mappe via Fjern Server Agent\"."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:91
msgid "Step 2 - Run the Installer Package"
msgstr "Trin 2 - Kør installationspakken"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:93
msgid "Click **\"Run\"** to start the installation."
msgstr "Klik på **\"Kør\"** for at starte installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:98
msgid "RUN THE SERVER AGENT INSTALLER"
msgstr "KØR SERVERAGENTINSTALLATIONEN"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:101
msgid "Step 3 - Welcome Screen"
msgstr "Trin 3 - Velkomstskærm"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:103 ../../chapter02.rst:111
msgid "On the Welcome Screen choose **\"Next\"** to continue."
msgstr "På velkomstskærmen vælg **\"Næste\"** for at fortsætte."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:108
msgid "WELCOME SCREEN"
msgstr "VELKOMSTSKÆRM"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:114
msgid "Step 4 - License Agreement"
msgstr "Trin 4 - Licensaftale"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:116
msgid ""
"Read and accept the license agreement by choosing **\"I Agree\"** and "
"click the **\"Next\"** button."
msgstr "Læs og accepter licensaftalen ved at vælge **\"Jeg accepterer\"** og klik på **\"Næste\"** knappen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:121
msgid "ACCEPT LICENSE AGREEMENT"
msgstr "ACCEPTER LICENSAFTALEN"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:124
msgid "Step 5 - Confirm Installation"
msgstr "Trin 5 - Bekræft installation"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:126
msgid ""
"Now we will complete the File Server Agent installation. Click "
"**\"Next\"** to finish."
msgstr "Nu vil vi afslutte installationen af File Server Agent. Klik på **\"Næste\"** for at afslutte."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:131
msgid "CONFIRM INSTALLATION"
msgstr "BEKRÆFT INSTALLATION"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:134
msgid "Step 6 - Installation is Finishing"
msgstr "Trin 6 - Installationen afsluttes"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:136
msgid "It will only take a few minutes to complete the installation."
msgstr "Det vil kun tage få minutter at fuldføre installationen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:141
msgid "FINAL INSTALLATION PROCESS"
msgstr "SLUTINSTALLATIONSPROCES"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:144
msgid "Step 7 - Installation Complete"
msgstr "Trin 7 - Installationen er fuldført"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:146
msgid ""
"Once the installation is completed, click the **\"Close\"** button to "
"finish."
msgstr "Når installationen er afsluttet, skal du klikke på **\"Luk\"** knappen for at afslutte."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:151
msgid "CLOSE INSTALLATION WINDOW"
msgstr "LUK INSTALLATIONSVINDUET"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:154
msgid "Step 8 - Restart Your System"
msgstr "Trin 8 - Genstart dit system"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:156
msgid "Just restart your system and File Server Agent is ready to use."
msgstr "Genstart blot dit system, og File Server Agent er klar til brug."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:161
msgid "RESTART YOUR SYSTEM"
msgstr "GENSTART DIT SYSTEM"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:165
msgid "Step 9 - Login To |prodname|"
msgstr "Trin 9 - Log ind på |prodname|"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:167
msgid ""
"After the reboot, log back into Windows as the same Windows user. Be "
"patient, as it will take a few minutes for the Login Panel to display. "
"Login to |prodname| as using your Tenant Administrator credentials."
msgstr "Efter genstarten skal du logge ind på Windows igen som den samme Windows-bruger. Vær tålmodig, da det vil tage nogle minutter for loginpanelet at blive vist. Log ind på |prodname| som din Tenant Administrator legitimationsoplysninger."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:170
msgid ""
"The File Server Agent can be logged in to the Tenant already if you don't"
" see the login dialog. You can go to the Web Portal side, login as the "
"Tenant Administrator and go to the \"Device Manager\" side to see the "
"File Server Agent."
msgstr "File Server Agenten kan allerede være logget ind på Tenanten, hvis du ikke ser login-dialogboksen. Du kan gå til Web Portal-siden, logge ind som Tenant Administrator og gå til \"Device Manager\"-siden for at se File Server Agenten."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:175
msgid "LOG IN AS TENANT ADMIN"
msgstr "LOG IND SOM TENANT ADMIN"

